flowchart LR
    L[Municipal source] --> E[Edge: fidelity transforms]
    E --> P[Plain Parquet + hash]
    N[DATASUS PF adapter] --> R[Raw objects + manifests]
    P --> R
    C[Control plane: Job / lease / fence] -.-> E
    R --> A[NormalizeSource per source]
    A --> B[ReconcileCompetencia]
    B --> M[MaterializeServing]
    M --> V[Verify outputs + immutable DatasetVersion]
    V --> CAS{CAS CURRENT + valid fence}
    CAS -->|success| U[Authorized serving for one pinned version]
    CAS -->|conflict or failure| OLD[Keep previous CURRENT]
    C -.-> CAS
    D[DELTA rejected by policy] --> F[Resync marker; no auto replacement]
    F --> J[Explicit later FULL job]
    J --> E
    classDef planned stroke:#baafff,stroke-dasharray:5 5
    class A,B,M,V,CAS,U planned
